        "name": "USN-6190-2",
        "description": "USN-6190-1 fixed a vulnerability in AccountsService. This update provides the corresponding update for Ubuntu 14.04 LTS, Ubuntu 16.04 LTS and Ubuntu 18.04 LTS.  Original advisory details:   Kevin Backhouse discovered that AccountsService incorrectly handled certain  D-Bus messages. A local attacker could use this issue to cause  AccountsService to crash, resulting in a denial of service, or possibly  execute arbitrary code.",
